window.products.push({"id":506135,"name":"CALA Futon Cover,Couch Covers for Dogs,Sofa Covers for 3 Cushion Couch,Furniture Protector with Elastic Straps,Futon Slipcover Throw for Pets, Kids Ca","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Nsipm2GgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"CALA brand specialized in household items,dedicated to bringing high quality and comfortable product to you. This slipcover shields and protects your furniture from spills, stains, wear and tear to prevent it from getting ruined. It’s great for homes with children and pets, or for anyone seeking an economical solution for furniture protection. WHAT SIZE SHOULD I ORDER? We HIGHLY RECOMMEND measuring before ordering as every piece of furniture is unique and we want you to be happy with the fit. You can find a detailed measuring guide in the photos as follows: Sofa Oversized: seat width up to 78\" Futon: seat width up to 70\" Sofa: seat width up to 68\" Loveseat: seat width up to 46\" Recliner: seat width up to 30\" Chair: seat width up to 21\" HOW CAN I BE SURE THE PROTECTOR WILL STAY IN PLACE CALA Futon covers feature the newest design which have both two loops on the front and back of the sofa cover and four straps. There are two ways to use it: *1.FASTEN PROTECTOR FROM FRONT TO BACK.* Tie strap through front loop-Go through under seat-Tie strap through back loop.(Refer to the picture above) *2.FASTEN THE FOUR SIDES.* The front and back four loops of the sofa cover are bundled with the four footrests of the sofa. It can reduce slipping,keep sofa cover stay in place. Please note, minor adjustments will be needed with rowdy dogs and kids.If you are looking for great and cost-effective way of re-inventing the function and protect your sofa, this is the way! CAN I PUT THIS IN THE WASHING MACHINE? Of course. This couch cover is machine washable and dryer safe. Directions are included with the cover. IF I ORDER IT AND IT DOES’S FIT, CAN I RETURN IT? Absolutely. We want you to be happy. If you are not happy for any reason (even after Amazon return window), please reach out to us directly for a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Nsipm2GgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAZY CALA LIFE","source_asin":"B07DPFMBNF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-506135","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DPFMBNF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DPFMBNF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":506136,"name":"Maiija 3 Piece Embossed Pattern Oversized Bedspread Coverlet 106x100 (Queen, Turquoise II)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1yot6IUvSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A perfect bedspread coverlet to use as a layering piece or an alternative to your comforter for a new solid look. The elegant hotel style embossed pattern easily fits your existing décor and will sure to add a new decorative element to your bedroom. The 100% blended cotton/microfiber fill that is super soft and light weighted that can be a perfect bedspread or coverlet which are large enough to tuck in your bed mattress. Better yet, those patterns are made with new heat transfer technology instead of threads, eliminating the common quality problems with loose thread and needle holes. For your information, Microfiber fabric is just as good and soft as cotton sheets. Microfiber is composed of very finely woven fibers, defined by their thickness, or denier, which is the measurement of a fiber’s thickness. A high denier points to a material of higher thickness, a low denier is one of lower thickness. A fine microfiber sheet set can also be know 95 to 100 gsm.They can be made from wood pulp, or polyester and nylon polymers. Microfiber are very thin, but are strong and exceptionally smooth and comfortable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1yot6IUvSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maiija","source_asin":"B072SJSY84","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-506136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072SJSY84","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072SJSY84","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":506137,"name":"hOmeLabs 11.6 Quart XXL 8-in-1 Air Fryer Oven - Bake, Broil, Dehydrate and More - Complete Set of Dishwasher Safe Accessories Included","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DKMehuj5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"15.4\" x 12.6\" x 14.2\" electric air fryer with 11.6-quart capacity that can cook up to 4 lbs of chicken inside. It uses hot-air circulation and cooks your food from all angles without using oil and 1700W heating elements cook food faster. This fryer can make food healthier and without unwanted odor by doing away with frying. Unlike others, this air fryer oven comes with a rotisserie chicken function that can roast chicken evenly with its 360° superheated cyclonic air and rotation. It also comes with a dehydrator function with 90-170°F preset settings that allows you to create healthy snacks at home. Roasting accessories and dehydrator trays included. This air fryer oven is smartly designed with its 1-60 minute built-in timer and auto shut off function that prevents your food and the appliance from overheating and burning. With a stylish modern design and a user friendly LED touchscreen display that shows the 8 cooking modes for different varieties of cooking. It also comes with a control dial to easily increase and decrease the time and temperature of the fryer. This air fryer oven is well-made with stainless steel and a thermal protective see-through double-layered glass door with an internal warm light so it's easy to have a glimpse of the food inside. This also comes with anti-slip feet to ensure stability on an uneven surface. This air fryer with accessories provides everything you need. It comes with a rotating basket for your fries and roasted nuts and other snacks. It also comes with dehydrating racks, adjustable skewer racks, oil tray, rotisserie fetch tool, and rotisserie shaft for your roast chicken. The accessories are dishwasher safe, so enjoy a hassle-free cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DKMehuj5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"hOmeLabs","source_asin":"B089KQ2YJY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-506137","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089KQ2YJY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089KQ2YJY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
