window.products.push({"id":506280,"name":"Happy Birthday Rainbow Banner With a Matching Cut Out Heart Decoration Garland Hanging Party Supplies","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W8VwI0CpL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"These Happy Birthday Party Rainbow Hangings are the perfect decoration supply for your kids birth day party. These are the decorations, which you can hang it on a wall or your ceiling and see your party come to life. The Rainbow Garlands are loved equally by kids and adults and make any party the most happening party within a matter of minutes.  ● These Paper Heart Garlands make great party decorations as well as photo props. ● These vibrant Hanging Garlands can easily be incorporated into whatever theme you’ve chosen for the party. ● We have hand selected the best birthday decoration kit so that you can decorate with ease, and Can be reused several time. HOW TO ASSEMBLE BIRTHDAY BANNER: ● For Making the Banner from the Buntings of “Happy♥ Birthday” words, you will get 14 Buntings, Two 8 Feet Red Color Ribbon Strings & One 3” Plastic Needle. ● There are 2 holes in each bunting, with the help of Plastic Needle you have to pull out the string from one hole & put it into the other hole of bunting & keep on adding the buntings alphabetically to make 2 \"Happy♥\" & \"Birthday\" Banners.● You can also join the strings to make a long Single \"Happy♥ Birthday\" Banner. OTHER FEATURES: ● Add A Perfect Touch to any Birthday Party with the Beautiful Multi-Color Combination of Garlands Give Pretty and Cute Shimmering Look ● Make Party Planning A Magic: Organizing and Planning Birthday Parties are always a pain BUT not anymore. Our perfect Garlands Package will make your party planning very easy. ● Quality: The high quality Rainbow Paper Heart Decorations will definitely catch the attention of your loved ones when they shimmer in the light. ● So Many Uses: Use them as a photo props and then hang them over the dessert table at the birthday party.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W8VwI0CpL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"envizins","source_asin":"B074F4BHJR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-506280","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074F4BHJR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074F4BHJR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
