window.products.push({"id":506368,"name":"Malicosmile Dream Catchers White for Bedroom, Handmade Hanging Decorations White Feather Lace Dream Catcher Mobile for Girls Room Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jgFVT8btL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Dreamcatcher was originated from the 18th century. Indians used it to capture the beautiful dreams and let the nightmares vanish with the appearance of the morning sunshine. They believed that the nights were filled with various dreams and only the Dreamcatcher can filter the bad ones and bring them into sweet ones. 1. Product Basic Information: ♥ Material: Iron ring + ABS beads + Feather + Lace + Cotton thread; ♥ Size: Measures 7.8 inches (20cm) in diameter, about 23.6 inch (60cm ) in length; ♥ Color: Pure White; 2. Product Features: ♥ The white dream catcher is handmade. Each process is made by a worker who has many years of weaving experience, and only skilled workers can weave such a uniform, perfect and rhythmic grid; ♥ The beads are polished and treated with the color preserving paint. The color of the hanging decoration is bright and clean, and the sleek and glossy design makes the white dream catchers unique; ♥ The white feathers are fumigated and then carefully screened to ensure that each feather is flawless and trimmed by the master; ♥ Because of its beautiful design and symbols, both adults and children will enjoy with it; ♥ The dream catcher feather mobile waves beautifully and quietly in the air, it will not disturb you and it will pray for peace and good luck with you. 3. Product Application: ♥ The dream catcher is perfect to hang in bedroom, living room, window, on the wall, at the entrance, balcony, at weddings or parties, etc to decorate your house or anywhere you want; ♥ It is a great gift idea for your friends or families with best wishes and love to them. 4. Note: Our dream catchers are pure handmade, so it is very normal if there is a little difference between each one. 5. Guarantee: If there is any question, please feel free to contact us, We will reply you within 24 hours and do our best to satisfy you","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jgFVT8btL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Malicosmile","source_asin":"B08NVW7HSH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-506368","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NVW7HSH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NVW7HSH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
