window.products.push({"id":506392,"name":"Bliss Casa Bath Towels (4 Pack) 500 GSM Premium Quality Natural Ring Spun Cotton Highly Absorbent and Eco-Friendly 27 x 54 Inch Bath Towels Set (Beige","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WBGpLq6wL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"NATURAL COTTON - Wrap yourself in luxury with our wonderful bath towels. Our 100% ring spun cotton bath towels are soft and plush. We make our shower towels using finest pure cotton. We focus on details, ensuring a perfect finish on every piece. HIGHLY ABSORBENT - Material is important in terms of absorbance, softness, color-fastness and durability. Bath towels can be made from a variety of different fibers, so it’s always a good idea to check the care tag to see the fiber content. We use mature cotton fibers, they’re just the right weight for optimum softness, fluffiness and are wonderfully absorbent. LONG LASTING & DURABLE - Our towels are rigorously checked for quality control throughout the production process. During the weaving process, we pass the cloth over a lighted inspection table. Here the weavers and quality inspectors monitor the towel for weaving imperfections. As in all aspects of the process, visual checks are a key to quality control—all involved in the process the produce the best. GENTLE ON SKIN - They are intentionally designed to the best potential specification so they remain light-weight, have a soft feel and great absorption. This gives your body a fragile feel whereas retaining the moisture. Choose your pick from our latest bath towel collection. MONEY BACK GUARANTEE - We sincerely value our customers and their opinions. If you are not satisfied with our quality by any mean, we offer a 30-day money back guarantee without any question. They do not require any hard and fast maintenance just wash them before first use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WBGpLq6wL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bliss Casa","source_asin":"B08B4TJRJM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-506392","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B4TJRJM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B4TJRJM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
