window.products.push({"id":506507,"name":"Rolanstar L Shaped Gaming Desk with Drawer, 55.1\" Reversible Computer Desk with Power Outlets & LED Lights, Home Office Desk with Monitor Stand & Stor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ippO4evIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Power】This computer desk includes a built in 4 outlets and 2 USB ports for your PC, monitor, phone, iPad, PS5 and other electronic devices at the same time. 【Cool LED RGB Light Strips Kit】The L shaped desk is equipped with LED light strips, which can provide 20 colors and 21 dynamic modes. When entertaining, dim the lights and choose your favorite colors to fully immerse yourself in the game. When working, match your favorite color to make you work more focused.It features memory function which keeps the LED light strips staying on last mode when turned on. The LED light strips are in multiple control modes via 17 keys remote and controller box. 【Large Space & Keep Your Spine Healthy】The overall size of this L shaped gaming desk is 18.9\"(D) x 55.1\"(W) x 55.1\"(W) x 34.7\"(H). With an extra large desktop space to provide you with the space you need to meet your needs without taking up too much space in your house, this L shaped computer desk can be placed anywhere in your home, even in the corner. This L shaped computer desk offers a full-size monitor stand that can hold 2-4 monitors at the same time, keeping it parallel to your line of sight no matter where you place it, giving you a better posture for work or play. 【Drawer & Adjustable Storage Shelves】Rolanstar computer desk is equipped with under-desk drawer and storage shelves. The drawer provide you with convenient under-desk storage and ensure the neatness of your desktop. This L shaped computer desk has two desktops. You can choose to install the drawer and storage shelves on the left or right side of the computer desktop according to your habits, and the dividers above the storage shelves can be moved or removed to provide convenient storage space for you to place items of different heights, making it more convenient for you to use. 【High Quality Board & Sturdy Frame】Computer desk made of Particle Board, sturdy, durable, and anti-scratched.Meets EPA TSCA Title VI and Carb certifications and rigid metal frame to provide a safe and healthy home office bedroom environment. Adjustable leg pads can keep the desk stable on uneven floor, protect the floor from scratches.Required installation tools and instructions are included in the package.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ippO4evIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rolanstar","source_asin":"B0BYRGFLGC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-506507","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYRGFLGC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYRGFLGC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
