window.products.push({"id":506546,"name":"WISH TREE Leopard Blanket, Cheetah Print Blanket Fuzzy Plush Fleece Throws and Blankets with Leopard Print for Sofa, Couch, Bed (60 * 80 Inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RAVZSLpiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM MATERIAL: This ultra soft leopard print blanket is made from 100% microfiber polyester which is ventilate, comfortable and durable. Constructed using techniques that include better stitching and with high tensile strength, making it strong and less likely to rip or tear. This leopard blanket will be no shedding, no pilling, no fading, no shrinking. VARIOUS SIZE: The cheetah blanket have two sizes to choose. Throw blanket - 50 x 60 inch (130 x 150cm): suitable for using as outdoor blanket, sofa blanket and travel blanket, lightweight and easy to carry. Large Blanket - 60 x 80 inch (150 x 200 cm): this size is more suitable for using in bed and couch. COZY & LIGHTWEIGHT: The soft and lightweight fuzzy blanket and throws is not only perfect for summer sleep, but also warm enough for winter. The cheetah print fleece blanket will provide substantial warmth and excellent experience to you when reading, watching TV series, taking a break from work or traveling, especially on chilly night. This cheetah blankets that can be used all year round. MULTIPLE-USE: The plush leopard throw blanket is perfect to use in indoor and outdoor activities. The leopard print blankets can used as bed blankets / shawl blankets / air-conditional blankets / nap blankest / kids blanket / travelling blankets /camping blankets. In addition, this blanket also can be used as pet blankets, intimate and warm. EASY TO CARE: Please clean the leopard throw blankets separately. Machine wash in cold water, the washing temperature should not exceed 30°, because high temperature soaking will destroy the fiber structure, gentle cycle, tumble dry low, do not bleach. Tumble dry on lowest heat. Avoid prolonged exposure to the sun and just dry in a cool, ventilated place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RAVZSLpiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WISH TREE","source_asin":"B0BF51L6Q6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-506546","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF51L6Q6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF51L6Q6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
