window.products.push({"id":506575,"name":"GoPong Rain or Shine Umbrella Flask 2 Pack - Hidden Alcohol Booze Bottles, Includes Funnel and Liquor Bottle Pour Spout","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ciRieFdtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GoPong's Rain or Shine Umbrella Flasks are designed to look like regular umbrellas so you can fill them with your favorite alcohol and take it to any indoor and outdoor event. Any suspicious eyes will quickly look over your umbrellas and allow you to bring your flask almost anywhere. We do not condone any illegal uses, but like you, we hate having to use up our spending money on overpriced drinks. Each flask holds 12oz (8 shots) and can easily be filled through its extra wide mouth (small funnel also included). Its screw cap provides an air-tight seal to prevent any leaking of liquid or odors. Once you are ready to drink, simply unscrew the cap and mix with your favorite beverage. This 2 Pack includes an 1 Black and 1 Navy umbrella so you can sneak 2 kinds of alcohol around. The flasks will pay for themselves after one use, so get yours today! Please remember to always obey all local drinking laws.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ciRieFdtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GoPong","source_asin":"B07XPRZWF1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-506575","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XPRZWF1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XPRZWF1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":506576,"name":"POP AirFry Mate, Stainless Steel French Fry Cutter, Commercial Grade Vegetable and Potato Slicer, Includes 2 Blade Size Cutter Options and No-Slip Suc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611Y5O0+SqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MULTIPURPOSE: Now you can get restaurant-quality fries right at home! Comes with two interchangeable blades that perfectly cut 1/2\" thick or 3/8\" thin - 3\" long pieces of fries. Perfect at cutting potatoes, and carrots. Also, great for prepping vegetables like onions, zucchinis, cucumbers. NOT RECOMMENDED FOR SWEET POTATOES EASY TO USE: Effortlessly prep your fries and vegetables. Our heavy-duty pulldown lever firmly presses your potato through the sharp stainless steel blades. Built with sturdy legs and suction cup base for optimal leverage while cutting. Simply place our French fries cutter on any flat smooth surface and lock in the suction cup to prevent slippage. Locking systems ensure the blades don't move while cutting for a consistent cut. COMPACT, DURABLE, AND EASY TO CLEAN: Compact design (10 inches by 5 inches) takes up minimal space in your kitchen. Stainless steel material and commercial grade lever are designed for years of use. Interchangeable blades can only be inserted one way preventing any unintentional misuse or damage. Dishwasher safe and can quickly be washed with soap and water. PERFECT CUTTER TO COMPLEMENT ANY FRYER: Our Fry cutter is designed to easily prep fries at a perfect length for deep fryers and air fryers. At 3\" length per fry, you don't need to worry about fitting oversized fries in your fryer. Prepare fries for a snack, party, or dinner with ease. QUALITY BACKED BY GUARANTEE: We always thrive for 100% customer satisfaction. That’s why offering a life-time warranty for this product was a no-brainer for us. If anything is not to your complete satisfaction, simply reach out to us and we will make it right! Guaranteed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611Y5O0+SqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POP","source_asin":"B07T4JJRSX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-506576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T4JJRSX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T4JJRSX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
