window.products.push({"id":506686,"name":"COTA Global Giraffe Snow Globe - Wildlife Animal Water Globe Figurine with Sparkling Glitter, Zoo Collectible Novelty Ornament for Home Decor, for Bir","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81naGkYP5lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Show your love for animals and wildlife creatures like the gorgeous Giraffe and make your home feel more sparkly with the fun tabletop decor. The animal snow globe figurines have hand-painted, colorful bases with realistic-looking, detailed 3D designs. CoTa Global’s Giraffe Stone Snow Globe is a must-have collectible home decor for all animal lovers and snowglobe enthusiasts. The beautiful Snow Globe Figurine collection can be used as tabletop decor for a living room coffee table, or as a fun accent piece on a shelf, and kitchen counter. The cute design of the figurines with snow globes would look perfect in a themed bedroom and anyone can play with the cute room decor! Makes a cool giveaway at themed events parties. Perfect gift for Birthdays, Christmas, or Valentine’s! A stunning animal glitter globe for snow globe collectors to add to their novelty snow globe collection. Families will be entertained by the beautiful glitters that fall on the mini creatures inside the globes like multicolored snows. Teens and adults alike would love the unique snow globe decoration and would surely take turns in shaking the Giraffe snow globe! The snow globe glitter domes are made with strong and sturdy materials to allow users to shake the snow globes every time they wish to see the sparkly glitter fall. The clear liquid dome filled with colorful glitter is made with glass and the realistic hand-painted figurines are made with high-quality resin materials. Preserve the beauty of the wild animals stone snow globes by wiping it with a damp cloth. Includes 1 CoTa Global Giraffe Snow Globe, beautifully crafted with Giraffe figure in a 45mm snow globe attached to a bigger Giraffe shape figurine. Features multi-colored glitters that look like magical snow falling down on the little Giraffe inside the snowglobe. The collectible Giraffe figure snowglobe measures about 3.5Lx2.1Wx3.9H inches, perfect accent on any tabletop.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81naGkYP5lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Puzzled","source_asin":"B0BJJSX9F4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-506686","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJJSX9F4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJJSX9F4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":506687,"name":"Old Modern Handicrafts Gas Pump with Clock Collectible, 1:4-Scale","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bbDY0mv3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The first gas pumps were built in the 1880s by the bowser company in fort Wayne, Indiana, followed in 1898 by pumps that could pull fuel from an underground tank. As the automobiles popularity soared in the1920s, service stations sprang up everywhere and the gas pump became a key promotional medium. The early pumps were visible gas pumps, with a clear glass cylinder, usually 5 or 10 gallons on top of the pump, so you could see what you were getting, or if the gas was dirty (a big problem at that time). There was a manual pump you'd pull back and forth to pump the gas out of the underground tank into the cylinder, which was 8 or 10 feet tall. From there the gas flowed by gravity down the hose into the car. Some of the most collectible pumps are the early ones with the cylinder on top and the old clock face that keeps track of just gallons. Also in demand are the computing pumps from the 1930's into the 1950's, but in the 1960's they modernized them, making them more boxy and plain. Pumps from the 1930s in particular have a lot of great art deco styling (and are very tall).the First gas pumps were built in the 1880s by the bowser company in fort Wayne, Indiana, followed in 1898 by pumps that could pull fuel from an underground tank. This beautiful antique replica gas pump has a working clock and is soldered, hand shaped, and hand painted in red. The decaled insignia and painted details give more of an authentic look. Intricate details are portrayed in the text, license plates, and metal wiring. It is made of iron and carefully handcrafted with an average of forty man-hours to complete. A stunning antique gas pump to display in your home or office.100% Iron frame, clock uses one aa battery (battery not included),rubber gas hose.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bbDY0mv3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Old Modern Handicrafts","source_asin":"B00RQE303W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-506687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RQE303W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00RQE303W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
