window.products.push({"id":506758,"name":"Bluearks Anti-Slip Stickers kit, Non-Slip Safety Bathtub Strips, Stickers Strips for Bathroom, Stairs Steps, Pools (24pcs)-Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hwlyovdbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Easy to use】The product is easy to install. After cleaning the surface, tear off the backing paper and flatten it. Tips:The air blower will make anti-slip stickers stick longer. 【Comfortable material】Made of PEVA material, soft and comfortable, with firm adhesive. Not easy to fall off, no peculiar smell 【Design principle】There are about hundreds of tiny particle protrusions on the surface of each anti-slip sticker, which increases friction, and the thickness is just right, providing strong adhesion and grip。 【Multi-purpose】Suitable for any smooth surface, such as your bathtub/shower room/stairs/ladder and boat/kitchen/hall/pool, etc. 【Set Combination】 You will get 24 anti-slip stickers and 1 scraper. The size of the anti-slip stickers is 0.5*7 in, and the size of the scraper is 5.2*2.3 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hwlyovdbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bluearks","source_asin":"B09KGNC8NZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-506758","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KGNC8NZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KGNC8NZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":506759,"name":"Pacific Merchants Acaciaware 15- by 12-Inch Acacia Wood Oval Serving Tray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rOKj7KhnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether you're looking for a gift to give or a gift for yourself; whether you're looking for something for the holidays, special occasions or every day use, Acaciaware is an exceptional choice. The Acaciaware Oval Tray can be used to serve snacks, appetizers and main dishes. It measures 15 by 12-inch. Acaciaware, by Pacific Merchants, is the highest quality and best valued Acacia woodenware available on the market; the bowls are hand turned from one solid piece of Acacia hardwood and the serving pieces are hand carved, making each one a unique, sculptured work of art! Acaciaware is a dense, naturally resinous hardwood which, by its very nature, resists penetration by water and will not absorb stains or odors. Acaciaware also means \"easy care\". Hand wash with warm soapy water and air dry. It doesn’t typically require oil but, if for some reason it appears to be drying out, simply use a non-toxic mineral oil to restore the wood grain to its original beauty. Creating high quality woodenware is not Pacific Merchants only concern, they are also concerned about the environment. Their wood sources do not harm the environment by using \"slash and burn\" methods of harvesting trees. All of their wood is \"harvested with care\" meaning that the trees they use are harvested legally from privately owned lands, which are highly regulated and monitored by the government. Pacific Merchants cares about sustaining the environment and are constantly looking for wood sources.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rOKj7KhnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PACIFIC MERCHANTS","source_asin":"B002S52BJI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-506759","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002S52BJI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002S52BJI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
