window.products.push({"id":506868,"name":"Casa Basics Quick Dry 2 Pieces Extra Large Egyptian Cotton (20 inches by 36 inches) Hand Towels - Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q7IOBrQ6L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Casa Basics is the economy brand from the Casa Copenhagen range of Luxury home furnishing collections. The towels in this Premium Quick dry collection are especially produced for regular use. They are produced from combed yarn wherein the cotton fibers are literally been \"combed\" to remove short, uneven fibers and debris resulting in longer, stronger and more lustrous cotton perfect for weaving. Such long fibers increase absorbing efficiency of the towel fabric. They pull the moisture \"around\" the fibers and spreads it across the surface, so it can dry 3-4 times faster than conventional fabrics. Hence, every repeated unwashed use, gets the same feel. These set of towels are to match the need for a perfect traveler or fitness enthusiast. The size of towels are not to big, so as to become inconvenient to carry and not too small for your regular use. The variety of colors give you a choice as per your taste.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q7IOBrQ6L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Casa Basics","source_asin":"B017NY3QG0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-506868","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017NY3QG0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017NY3QG0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":506869,"name":"SlipX Solutions Bottomless Bath | Overflow Drain Cover for Tub | Best Gifts for Mom, Spa & Bath Accessories | Drain Block, Water Stopper Plug | Bath E","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KoJBjXN7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bottomless Bath is a must have bath essential for your tub to enjoy a better bath experience. A few extra inches of water makes all the difference! Treat yourself to a luxury spa like bath with this overflow drain cover. Bath accessories for the tub women love! Stop listening to water trickle down the drain and sink into bubbles, salts, magnesium flakes, and scented soaps in peace. The Bottomless Bath prevents water from entering the perimeter of the overflow drain, so you can soak in peace. Designed with power grip, reliable suction cups that create an ultra-tight seal. Our proven high-quality material and design creates a powerful long-last seal. When you're filling the tub, simply run warm water over the suction cups and press each suction cup firmly against the tub. Perfect Fit for Most Drains: Measuring 4-inch inner diameter and 2 in. deep, the Bottomless Bath fits commonly found bathtub overflow drains, like toggle/trip lever, flat, or snap drain types. This bathroom overflow tub drain cover makes the perfect Birthday and Christmas gifts for a mom who has everything! The Bottomless Bath is also backed by the SlipX Solutions Peace of Mind Promise. Simply reach out to our friendly Customer Care Team via Amazon with any questions or concerns after using it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KoJBjXN7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SlipX Solutions","source_asin":"B09ZGTD5DS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-506869","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZGTD5DS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZGTD5DS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
