window.products.push({"id":506871,"name":"Silicone Storage Bag,Ultra-Thick Reusable Silicone Food Bag,Silicone Bags for Food Storage Freezer,Versatile Silicone Bags for Vegetable,Liquid,Snack,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+MC8kSMYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Does your preservation bag really keep fresh? While the disposable fresh-keeping bag brings us convenience, it also brings a heavy burden to the environment. In addition, are the fresh-keeping bags in your refrigerator really fresh? Disposable fresh-keeping bags cannot be completely sealed, and the surface will have frost after freezing for a long time, and the surface of the bag will become hard and easy to break...so it is time to replace them. \" Size description: 2 medium (1L / 30oz) + 2 large (1.5L / 50oz)2 medium(1L / 30oz) + 1 extra large (3L / 102oz)2 extra large (3L/102oz) Reminder: When heating in the microwave, open the fresh-keeping bag, do not put the sealing strip in the microwave, and be careful of burns when taking it.Everyone on Earth should understand the issue and have the chance to make informed choices.According to relevant scientific reports, human have produced 18.2 trillion pounds (about 8.26 billion tons) of plastics, but less than 9% of all of the plastic have been recycled.Plastic ends up in landfills where it can take hundreds of years to break down. And if the plastic doesn’t end up in a landfill, it could end up in the ocean, where it can cause pollution and marine animal deaths.silicone bags reusable storage is to reduce the use of disposable plastic bags, provide people with safe, convenient, green and reusable food storage bags, trying our best to save our planet, would you like to join in us?","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+MC8kSMYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ubrand","source_asin":"B08R5XRJ8D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-506871","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R5XRJ8D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R5XRJ8D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
