window.products.push({"id":506905,"name":"TIKUSAN Ceramic Ripple Ridge Mortar & Pestle (Suribachi & Surikogi) Set with Spout 7.1 inches Made in Japan (Brown)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5194-m4Q1BL._SL1080_.jpg","description":"Grinding with a mortar will enhance the aroma and produce a smooth texture. Sesame seeds and garlic will also become more flavorful when ground in a mortar. Using a mortar is ideal for making dressing, sauce, and baby foods. The deep shape of this mortar allows ingrediants to be easilymixed and the wide rim makes cleaning a breeze.Placing a wet towel underneath the mortar is recommended to increase stability. This mortar is one of the traditional craftworks of Japanese pottery that provides 60% of the production in the Japanese mortar market. The style of this mortar comes from the Japanese craft, ”Mino-yaki”（Mino ware）. With such a unique and beautiful design, the mortar itself can also function as a stylish bowl. It has a spout which helps prevent spillage when pouring grated ingredients. Size: Dia 7.1 inch x Height 3.5 inch, Weight: 1.85 lb","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5194-m4Q1BL._SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TIKUSAN","source_asin":"B0868DLQL7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-506905","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0868DLQL7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0868DLQL7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
