window.products.push({"id":506984,"name":"Embryant Touchless Automatic Soap Dispensers 3-Level Infrared Sensor Waterproof Base, Soap Dispenser for Bathroom Kitchen Countertop Hands-Free Soap D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BUtDkvrnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Touchless Battery-Operated Automatic Soap Dispenser Definitely Matches Your Room Large Capacity 400ML (13.5OZ) Transparent body, the amount of soap is clearly visible. Extra large soap dispenser reservoir allows you this item to be used for an extended period of time without needing a refill. One-button to power on/off To Switch ON : please press ~/'' ON~/'' button, switch Indicator light shows blue To Switch OFF : please press ~/'' OFF~/'' button, switch Indicator light shows red 3 Levels of Dispensing Volume The switch on the outside of the freestanding automatic hand soap dispenser, easy to adjust the amount of liquid Dispense and never waste. Waterproof Easy Use Designed with waterproof base and rubber seals to prevent the battery compartment from getting soaked in water which causes corrosion and the dispenser fail. Insert 4 ~aœAAA~a batteries (Not included) in the correct +/- battery compartment to make it work normally. Product Specifications Capacity: 13.5oz / 400ml Sensor range: 0~/''~2.4~/'' Battery-Operated: 4*AAA (not included) ~aš ¸Tips: ~a—1. Regular hand soap sanitizer should be diluted with water in a ratio of 1:2 or 1:3 to ensure normal discharge. ~a—2. Remove the batteries to avoid moisture and short circuit if not use it for a long time. ~a—3. Please reinstall it if the waterproof rubber ring inside falls off, so as to prevent the soap from leaking into the battery compartment. ~a—4. Avoid direct sunlight to the infrared panel. ~a—5. Don't immerse the soap dispenser (battery part) in water or clean it under running water, this will lead to short circuit. ~a—6.Don't insert the and old batteries into the battery compartment at the same time, this will reduce battery life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BUtDkvrnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Embryant","source_asin":"B0BCJ3M56Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-506984","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCJ3M56Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCJ3M56Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
